STATEMENT: >>>
Build Spice.Schematic (versioned diffable document model, hierarchical subsheets, ERC, Unified Device Descriptor binding, Canonical IR emitter, SPICE/StarLark/SVG export) and the initial Spice.App desktop schematic editor and waveform cross-probing viewer backed by ISimulationBackend.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M1
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-002
Deliverables: Cameo.Netlist (standalone zero-dependency packable .NET 11 library providing topology-first hierarchical spice.netlist.v3 / .spicenet parser/formatter/elaborator, dual electrical_sha256 + layout_sha256 hashes, deterministic signal-flow auto-placer, polyglot .spice.svg metadata codec, VeloSim velosim.netlist.v1 + velosim.rtl.v1 mixed-signal ingestion & round-trip importer, and derived tscircuit-aligned Circuit JSON view), Spice.Ir (DeviceRegistry + SpiceNetlistEmitter for all Slice A devices + OSDI), Spice.Schematic (CameoNetlistBridge adapter, versioned schema 2.1 SchematicDocument, multi-sheet RootSheet + SubSheets, SpiceLibraryImporter bulk .LIB/.MOD/.SUB importer, ComponentLibraryStore with 34 curated Foundation parts, SchematicCompiler, and SchematicExporter), Spice.App runnable .NET 11 host CLI & 3-pane EDA Schematic Studio + Library Studio SPA, Spice.Tests/{M1PlatformTests,SliceCLibraryAndModelPacksTests,FlagshipNetlistAndVeloSimTests,CameoNetlistRigorousTests,SpiceSchematicAndImporterRigorousTests,SpiceCoreAndCliRigorousTests}.cs.
Verification: .NET 11.0.100 Release build (TreatWarningsAsErrors=true) passes 145/145 xUnit tests with 0 warnings (including zero-Spice-reference assembly isolation check, standalone dotnet pack for Cameo.Netlist, 50 seeded hierarchical property trials + 300 seeded crash-freedom fuzz trials + 100 seeded SpiceLibraryImporter fuzz trials with reproducible seed=20261125, and minimized regression tests for 3 defects caught and fixed: null JSON collection handling in VeloSimIngestion.ImportVeloSimNetlistJson, lowercase 'a'/'f' SI prefix vs uppercase 'A'/'F' unit disambiguation in FlagshipNetlist.TryParseQuantity, and spaced 'key = value' SPICE .MODEL parsing in SpiceLibraryImporter). Real Coverlet XPlat Cobertura coverage across the .NET 11 solution: 86.93% lines (6047/6956) / 78.84% branches (3827/4854), including Cameo.Netlist 97.52% line / 92.78% branch, Spice.Starlark 100.00% line / 100.00% branch, Spice.Ir 92.66% line / 83.39% branch (SpiceNetlistEmitter 99.50% line), Spice.Schematic 88.60% line / 73.49% branch (CameoNetlistBridge 96.45% line, SpiceLibraryImporter 93.39% line / 91.85% branch), Spice.App 80.67% line / 68.85% branch (Program.cs 88.47% line), and Spice.Sdk 63.45% line / 63.84% branch (DifferentialComparer 96.55% line; uncovered paths mainly external Sandia Xyce CLI execution in XyceBackend.cs and generated P/Invoke stubs in LibraryImports.g.cs; static WorkbenchUi.cs HTML/JS template not instrumented as runtime branches).
