[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PLAN-V2-006
STATUS: InProgress
TITLE: M2b - Nonlinear DAE solver, autodiff B-sources and generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 loader
STATEMENT: >>>
Implement dimensioned Newton with voltage limiting and source/Gmin continuation (mandatory final Gmin removal), adaptive BE/Trapezoidal/BDF2 integration with breakpoints, compiled B-source expression VM with dual-number autodiff, and one generic OSDI 0.3/0.4 dynamic loader running OpenVAF-compiled Diode, VBIC/BJT, BSIM3, BSIM4, JFET, and EKV models, plus the native canonical SPICE3f5 parser/elaborator.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Phase: M2
Depends-on: PLAN-V2-005
Deliverables: cpp/solver (dimensioned Newton + step limiting + OSDI $limit/lim_rhs integration + Gmin/source continuation with mandatory gmin=0 final solve), cpp/analysis (variable-step BDF2 + adaptive Milne LTE step control with rollback & breakpoint landing), cpp/devices (full discrete Diode, MutualInductance K, compiled autodiff expr_vm B_v/B_i), cpp/osdi (binary-compatible official OSDI 0.3/0.4 ABI loader with stride-safe OSDI_DESCRIPTOR_SIZE, libm resolution, OSDI_LIM_TABLE pnjlim/fetlim/limvds, OSDI_LOG, $simparam, Union-Find node collapsing, lim_rhs, dynamic temperature re-setup, and load_noise adjoint projection), cpp/parser (native SPICE3f5 parser & hierarchical .SUBCKT/.PARAM/.MODEL/.OSDI elaborator), cpp/cli (spice_v2_cli with version/check/run, JSON/CSV export, deterministic exit codes), tests/m2b_{nonlinear_osdi,parser_lte_cli}_tests.cpp, tests/m2d_osdi_v04_tests.cpp, tests/fixtures/test_osdi_v04_full.c, tests/va/{va_diode,va_mos_sh}.va, scripts/diff_osdi_vs_ngspice.py.
Verification: GCC, Clang, and Windows MSVC -O3 -Werror builds pass all 12 CTest binaries (including OSDI 0.4 node collapsing, pnjlim/lim_rhs, $simparam, and load_noise analytical checks), AND Linux CI compiles real Verilog-A models (va_diode.va, va_mos_sh.va) via pinned OpenVAF-Reloaded v24.0.2mob and passes 9/9 head-to-head differential checks against ngspice (<4.1 uV OP/AC, 0.57-31 ppm integrated .NOISE RMS, exact RS/RD/RS node collapsing). Remaining to close M2b: full foundry BSIM4/VBIC/EKV OpenVAF differential corpus.
<<<
